## Using External Rust Crates

Declare dependencies in `native/Cargo.toml`:

```toml
[dependencies]
semver = "1"
```

MatchBox merges them into the generated build. Relative path dependencies resolve against `native/`. Do not redeclare crates supplied by Fusion, such as `matchbox_vm`.

Reusable native functionality can also live in a [module](/reference/language/modules/index.html).

